5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability. I worry about who does the work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into network coverage at customer plants and in-house developer availability. We need to know if the technical groundwork is actually there.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I will check the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work. We must know where the money comes from.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm interested in the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. Let's see what actually lasts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'll investigate time lost to copying existing records and misrouted deliveries in the incident logs. I want to see the daily losses.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, do you think the developers are too busy?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is exactly why I am checking. If they are unavailable, some proposals are impossible.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@May, looking at past failures is wise, but we cannot ignore the renewal costs of new software.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"True, George, but a cheap tool that nobody uses is the biggest waste of all.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with May. We should prioritize things that fix the actual frustrations of the staff.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we find a way to help the people who are already tired.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"We should also consider if we are relying on things we can't control, like external site access.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I remain concerned about the budget lines. We can't just assume the fund is a blank check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Midori, your focus on the floor is a good balance to George's financial caution.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, May. I just want the solution to be practical for the workers.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
