35,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The developers are busy until the third quarter, and the coordination group is understaffed. We can't add more manual work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found that network coverage at plants is very poor and visitor approval takes forever. Some ideas are technically unfeasible.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital budget is frozen, but we have a software allowance. Also, per-head licensing is more expensive than fixed fees.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Past rollouts show that tools requiring daily entry from everyone fail. Only narrow, trade-specific tools survived.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"People are losing an hour a day copying records, and misrouted deliveries are happening because of inconsistent addresses.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, if the budget is frozen, does that mean we can only use the software allowance?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, and if the developers are gone, we can't build anything complex in-house right now.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"Yes, Minato. We should avoid anything that requires a large capital outlay or expensive per-user licenses.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, the record copying you found sounds like exactly the kind of ""daily entry"" burden that usually fails.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"Perhaps, but the misrouted deliveries are a concrete error we can fix without asking everyone to do more work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,We need something that reduces the burden on the two people currently doing everything by hand.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Whatever we pick must work offline or not rely on customer plant networks, given the signal issues.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I suggest we look for a fixed-fee solution that fits within the existing software allowance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I agree. A narrow tool for a specific problem is more likely to survive than a broad ""assistant"" for everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we can consolidate the records, we stop the copying and the misrouting at the same time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
